# The ЭП2Д (PB_SETUP 15: САУТ and the УКБМ) on openRTS's КЛУБ, held at 72 km/h,
# САУТ in its mode, a red ahead, then a limit of 60: the КЛУБ's permitted speed
# (var + 140, the МПСУ dial's) stays as Brakes.dll's; САУТ's speed goes to the
# screen alone. It fell to 59 at each redraw (every 0.33 s) and the dial
# jerked (testers 2026-11-28).
0    voltage 25000 50
0    line_limit 90
0    line_signal S1 2500 1
2    switch 58 1
3    speed 20
5    switch 147 1
12   line_limit 60
12.50 expect var140 == 60
12.55 expect var140 == 60
12.85 expect var140 == 60
12.90 expect var140 == 60
12.95 expect var140 == 60
13.25 expect var140 == 60
13.30 expect var140 == 60
13.35 expect var140 == 60
13.65 expect var140 == 60
13.70 expect var140 == 60
13.75 expect var140 == 60
